  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ocean for Development Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of an institutional cooperation project between the Norwegian Institute of Marine Research (IMR) and the Kenya Marine and Fisheries Research Institute (KMFRI) on five topics to improve management and governance of marine resources: i) stock assessments, ii) Marine Spatial Planning, iii) marine aquaculture, iv) value addition and reduction of post-harvest losses (from fisheries and aquaculture), and v) blue carbon.</narrative>
  </description>
